# Starfleet Wormhole

A lightweight, Git-based communication channel between the repository owner, ChatGPT, and the Starfleetctl fleet.

## Start here

- [Collaboration protocol](COLLABORATION.md) — directory layout, message format, and operating rules.
- [Decisions](decisions/) — durable agreements that apply across messages.
- [Inbox](inbox/) — requests and instructions sent to the fleet.
- [Outbox](outbox/) — replies and hand-offs from the fleet.

## System boundaries

Starfleetctl remains authoritative for task tracking, dashboard state, agent execution, and its normal report workflow. This repository carries cross-system messages and durable coordination decisions; it must not become a parallel task tracker or report archive.

Use the default branch, `master`, unless the owner explicitly says otherwise.
